choosing the target project
  acts   enter use it · i type a key
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, home first row, end last row]
  full   [enter use the project under the cursor, i type a project key]
typing a project key
  acts   enter look it up · esc the list
  full   [enter look this key up, esc back to the projects]
  full   [alt+k delete to end of line]
choosing the issue type
  acts   enter use it · shift+tab back
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, home first row, end last row]
  full   [enter use this issue type, shift+tab back a step]
saying what each status becomes
  acts   ←/h previous · →/l next · enter carry on · shift+tab back
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, home first row, end last row]
  full   [←/h previous value, →/l next value]
  full   [enter carry on, shift+tab back a step]
answering what the target insists on
  acts   ←/h previous · →/l next · enter carry on · shift+tab back
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, home first row, end last row]
  full   [←/h previous value, →/l next value]
  full   [enter carry on, shift+tab back a step]
the confirm screen
  acts   y move them · n notify · shift+tab back
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, home first row, end last row]
  full   [y move them, n email the watchers, or do not, shift+tab back a step]
a move the queue has taken
  acts   
the outcome
  acts   enter close
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, home first row, end last row]
  full   [enter close]
